      "skipped": "Mac probe via xlwings reads blank for `=_xlfn.ANCHORARRAY(B1)` typed via the formula2 API even when B1 holds a static value. This is a harness probe artefact (Mac may not fully evaluate the explicit `_xlfn.` form when injected through xlwings) rather than the documented `ref#` semantics. Formulon implements the documented #REF! return for non-spill anchors, covered by spill_ref_eval_test.cpp."
